{"2873750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pool of Madness", "steam_appid": 2873750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Imagine Balatro and Inscryption had a baby. That taught itself to play pool. With bullets. In hell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool of Madness is a Lovecraftian roguelite pool by the creators of Dagon: by H. P. Lovecraft (1.8 million+ downloads).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOOT. LOOT. BLEED. REPEAT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/a0cd4e6220472718c6fc2780a7693029.poster.avif?t=1782887782\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/a0cd4e6220472718c6fc2780a7693029.webm?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/a0cd4e6220472718c6fc2780a7693029.mp4?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cue. Gun. Cosmic dread. Everything explodes. You <span class=\"bb_strike\">walk out</span> die in slow motion, a bloody grin on your blackened face.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a <strong>roguelite</strong> <strong>fusion </strong>of trick shots (<strong>pool</strong>), ricochets (<strong>pinball</strong>), and raw firepower (<strong>shooter</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>seamless cue-gun interplay</strong> for addictive flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pool tables are altars<strong>,</strong> cue and gun: instruments of the liturgy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perform rituals to lure out void horrors.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR CUE WITH NEW LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/397b1041a9157e5dfea797dcbb6d2786.poster.avif?t=1782887782\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/397b1041a9157e5dfea797dcbb6d2786.webm?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/397b1041a9157e5dfea797dcbb6d2786.mp4?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ever-evolving cue should make the next ritual easier. It will certainly make it different.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quickly <strong>upgrade your cue with collected parts and try out the upgraded build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unlock new powerups</strong>, complete the ritual and get ready for the next terror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and if all else fails, <strong>use your gun</strong> to blast your way out </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lose your mind, reforge your conduit, return stronger.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK IT TILL YOU MAKE IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/7174601e61458b993cb779d8674ffcb0.poster.avif?t=1782887782\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/7174601e61458b993cb779d8674ffcb0.webm?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/7174601e61458b993cb779d8674ffcb0.mp4?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like Dark Souls, Inscryption and… pool, PoM emphasises mystery, discovery and replayability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>break rules</strong> and improvise<strong> to survive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>discover blood-pumping synergies, multipliers, chain reactions</strong> and master the  chaos*</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*picture fish exploding midair in slo-mo, powerups raining down, balls bouncing off their tails and ramping into premium-scored pockets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ritual is law. Everything else is yours to break.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE VOID HORRORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/281f36c13ab72d5c8883b6496addb074.poster.avif?t=1782887782\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/281f36c13ab72d5c8883b6496addb074.webm?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/281f36c13ab72d5c8883b6496addb074.mp4?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rituals are your baptism of blood, preparing you to face a void lurker: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>complete rituals to <strong>lure out ancient horrors</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>hunt them down</i></strong><i>, get more loot, uncover the story of the missing ship crew</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or <strong>die </strong>trying -<strong> and come back stronger</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slay void beasts for loot.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALK - SPIN - HUNT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/0abcc55d859d543bc762f551a14d3bd3.poster.avif?t=1782887782\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/0abcc55d859d543bc762f551a14d3bd3.webm?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873750/extras/0abcc55d859d543bc762f551a14d3bd3.mp4?t=1782887782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So rise up, chalk the cue and spin the chamber, voidhunter, for the ritual begins anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>In other words: <strong>Shoot some balls. Go insane. Try again. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOMETHING WICKED THIS WAY COMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let it be known: this beast is still growing. The game is currently at an early stage of development. The playtests and media do not reflect the quality of the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15% of revenue donated to charity organisations (chosen with our community on Discord).</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Imagine Balatro and Inscryption had a baby. That taught itself to play pool. With bullets. In hell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pool of Madness is a Lovecraftian roguelite pool by the creators of Dagon: by H. P. Lovecraft (1.8 million+ down